{"step": 3, "action": "matrix-results", "utc": "2026-11-05T02:20:34.735733+00:00", "captures": ["03-0-matrix-results.png"], "artifacts": {"small-study.deeks_funnel.1": "03-0-small-study-deeks-2a186b43b76fb0.png"}, "texts": {"small-study.warning": "Primary asymmetry test: Deeks test\nResult: no clear evidence of small-study effects (p = 0.840)\nUsable studies: 17\nEstimate: 1.360 (95% CI -12.79 to 15.51)\n\nFunnel plot asymmetry can reflect publication bias, heterogeneity, study design, or chance.\n\nInterpret the plots and tests together. No single result proves or rules out publication bias.\n\nAnalysis warnings:\n- Observed Deeks ESS predictor range: [0.066089557, 0.27785947].", "small-study.data-eligibility": "Effect measure: Diagnostic odds ratio (DOR)\nStudies analyzed: 17\nConfidence level: 95% confidence interval\nPrimary test: Deeks test\nObserved standard-error range: [0.27546972, 1.6052732]\nContinuity correction: All studies if any zero exists\nPlot method: Deeks funnel plot using effective sample size", "small-study.tests": "Deeks test (meta implementation) (primary)\n  Studies: 17\n  Result: No clear evidence of small-study effects (p = 0.840).\n  Test statistic: 0.2049\n  Coefficient: 1.360 (SE 6.637; 95% CI -12.79 to 15.51)\n  Model: Deeks effective-sample-size weighted regression", "small-study.references": "1. Deeks test: Deeks, J. J., Macaskill, P., & Irwig, L. (2005). The performance of tests of publication bias and other sample size effects in systematic reviews of diagnostic test accuracy was assessed. Journal of Clinical Epidemiology, 58(9), 882-893. doi:10.1016/j.jclinepi.2004.06.012.\n2. Implementation reference: Viechtbauer, W. (2010). Conducting meta-analyses in R with the metafor package. Journal of Statistical Software, 36(3), 1-48. doi:10.18637/jss.v036.i03.\n", "small-study.method-details": "Deeks test (meta implementation)\n  Package: meta 8.5-0\n  Predictor: 1/sqrt(ESS), ESS=4*n.e*n.c/(n.e+n.c)\n  Weighting: native ESS weights\n  Inference: t-based Deeks regression test\n  Degrees of freedom: 15.00\n  Exact p-value: 0.84038411\n  Call: meta::metabin(event.e=TP, n.e=TP+FN, event.c=FP, n.c=FP+TN, sm='OR', incr=0.5, method.incr='if0all', common=TRUE, random=TRUE, method.tau='REML', level=0.95); meta::metabias(x=prepared.DOR.model, method.bias='Deeks', k.min=10, level=0.95)", "small-study.methods-not-applicable": "No additional methods were marked not applicable."}, "plots": {"small-study.deeks_funnel.1": "/home/ali/.t3/worktrees/rc-metastudio/t3-a7bf4ec3/build/verification/rcms/desktop-30p1cwr1/tmp/RtmpxN7LUi/small-study-deeks-2a186b43b76fb0.png"}, "visible_labels": [{"surface": "", "text": "Copy report"}, {"surface": ":tooltip", "text": "Copy report"}, {"surface": "", "text": "Export report"}, {"surface": ":tooltip", "text": "Export report"}, {"surface": "", "text": "Export plot"}, {"surface": ":tooltip", "text": "Export plot"}, {"surface": ":tooltip", "text": "Export format; remembered for your next plot and analysis."}, {"surface": ":choice", "text": "PDF"}, {"surface": ":choice", "text": "PNG"}, {"surface": ":choice", "text": "TIFF"}, {"surface": ":choice", "text": "SVG"}, {"surface": "", "text": "Edit plot"}, {"surface": ":tooltip", "text": "Edit plot"}, {"surface": "", "text": "Change settings"}, {"surface": ":tooltip", "text": "Re-run this analysis with its original dataset and changed settings."}, {"surface": "", "text": "Zoom:"}, {"surface": "", "text": "Fit width"}, {"surface": ":tooltip", "text": "Fit width"}], "visible_plot_labels": []}
